title Vinyl P2c: the Queue page has Add where Clear all was (no dialog); Play on a playlist, an album from the Library and a track of a folder each REPLACE the queue with exactly that list; Add opens the Library in the multi-select pick mode for the queue (marks, "ADDING TO THE QUEUE, N TRACKS", the Done button where the mini player is) and Done comes back to the Queue (640x480, the deck)
sizes 640x480
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY scan
env VINYL_DEMO_PLAYLISTS list
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
keyboards 1
wait 1200
key q
wait 600
shot 00-queue
expect text "Add"
expect notext "Clear all"
expect text "Move up"
expect noquit
# a playlist, from its page: Play replaces the queue with the playlist (the first track is playing, the rest follow)
key esc
wait 400
key b
wait 500
tap "Playlists"
wait 700
tap "Evening"
wait 800
tap "Play"
wait 1000
shot 01-playing
key q
wait 800
shot 02-queue-playlist
expect text "Lisztomania"
expect text "Amerie, 1 Thing (Siik Remix)"
expect notext "Hot Chip, Over and Over"
expect noquit
# the Library's album: the queue is the album
key esc
wait 400
key b
wait 500
tap "Search"
wait 600
type wolfgang
wait 900
key enter
wait 400
key enter
wait 800
tap "Play album"
wait 1000
key q
wait 800
shot 03-queue-album
expect text "Phoenix, 1901"
expect notext "Amerie, 1 Thing (Siik Remix)"
expect noquit
# Add: the Library in the pick mode, a tap adds at the end and the mark shows
tap "Add"
wait 800
shot 04-add-hub
expect text "ADDING TO THE QUEUE, 2 TRACKS"
expect text "Done"
expect notext "Move up"
tap "Songs"
wait 900
shot 05-add-songs
expect text "ADDING TO THE QUEUE, 2 TRACKS"
expect text "1901"
tap "1901"
wait 700
shot 06-add-again
expect text "Added to the queue."
expect text "ADDING TO THE QUEUE, 3 TRACKS"
tap "Done"
wait 800
shot 07-queue-after
expect text "Add"
expect text "Move up"
expect noquit
